@startuml GameScreen
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title GameScreen
rectangle c [
|= Responsibilities |= Collaborators |
| Build and update the scene tree | Node, Player, EnemyManager |
| Run the 5 minute timer and score | Enemy |
| Trigger pause, win and loss | GameStateManager |
| Draw map and HUD | TileMapRenderer |
| Start the large goose and tower defence events | EnemyManager, GameStateManager |
| Show event messages and award the defence bonus | EnemyManager |
]
@enduml
